WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.025 --> 00:00:06.599
Begin troubleshooting from the visible status line.

2
00:00:06.609 --> 00:00:12.079
Click View Errors when something fails.

3
00:00:12.089 --> 00:00:16.059
Click Copy Log to save the current activity messages.

4
00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:20.298
Open Help / About for quick guidance.

5
00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:26.958
Use the guide notes for safe operation reminders.

6
00:00:26.965 --> 00:00:33.815
Before closing, stop monitoring and confirm a safe state.
